          "id": "where-and-when",
          "value": {
            "topic": "arrival",
            "answer": "The market moved to Alden Town Park, 13140 Main St, across from the Village Triangle. It runs Mondays alongside the Alden Car Cruise, with a concession stand and live entertainment. The 2026 season ran 4:30pm to 7pm, June 1 to September 28."
          },
          "source_ids": [
            "erie-grown",
            "town-park",
            "chamber-market"
          ],
          "verified_at": "2026-11-01"
        },
        {
          "id": "what-is-sold",
          "value": {
            "topic": "products",
            "answer": "The market does not publish a vendor list. The Chamber has been recruiting more produce and meat vendors, so call (716) 937-6177 or email secretary@aldenny.org to ask who is coming that week."
          },
